@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:usagestart a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:usageend a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:user a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:User hpc:rdflistmember rdf:first hpc:UserItem ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:User ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Useritem.
hpc:Useritem a owl:Class.
hpc:Returntype a owl:Class;
    rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class.
hpc:v0043OpenapiAssocsResp a hpc:ReturnType.
hpc:Apiresponse a owl
